        "original_id": "2551ecc6-7362-5718-8500-93b3c5891dec",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimmy John Liautaud\n- Companies: Jimmy John's\n- Places: Champaign, Illinois; Alaska; Hawaii; Connecticut; Maine; New Hampshire; Vermont\n- Roles: founder; chairman; majority owner\n\nFacts:\n- James John Liautaud was born on January 12, 1964.\n- Jimmy John Liautaud is the founder, chairman, and majority owner of Jimmy John's.\n- Jimmy John Liautaud founded Jimmy John's in 1983.\n- Jimmy John's is headquartered in Champaign, Illinois.\n- In 30 years, Jimmy John's grew to more than 2,500 locations.\n- Jimmy John's had locations in every U.S. state except Alaska, Hawaii, Connecticut, Maine, New Hampshire, and Vermont.",
